  "name": null,
  "problem": "For which of the following values is the implicit Euler method stable, given that $\\lambda $ is the parameter of the test equation?\n\n- $\\lambda Δx=0.1$\n- $\\lambda Δx=0.8$\n- $\\lambda Δx=1.2$\n- $\\lambda Δx=5$\n\n*Hint: The stability function $R$ of the implicit Euler method is given by*\n\n$$\nR(\\lambda Δx)=\\frac{1}{1+\\lambda Δx}.\n$$",
